# language: en

Feature: Signal API Inspect

  Scenario Outline: HeadlessApp_Inspect_Signal
        Given PAL set a signal <path> to <datatype> <value>
        Then HeadlessApp can inspect the signal <path> of <datatype>


Examples:
    | path                                                     | datatype  | value     |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.AccumulatedBrakingEnergy | float | 0.0 |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.AspirationType | string | NATURAL |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.DieselExhaustFluid.IsLevelLow | bool | false |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.DieselExhaustFluid.Level | uint8 | 50 |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.DieselExhaustFluid.Range | uint32 | 2147483647 |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.Displacement | uint16 | 32767 |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.EngineCoolant.LifeRemaining | int32 | 0 |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.CombustionEngine.Torque | int16 | 0 |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.FuelSystem.RefuelPortPosition | string[] | ["FRONT_LEFT","FRONT_MIDDLE","FRONT_RIGHT"] |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.TractionBattery.Charging.ChargeCurrent.ThreePhaseCurrentMeasurements | complex | {"Phase1":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Phase2":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Phase3":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.TractionBattery.Charging.ChargeVoltage.ThreePhaseVoltageMeasurements | complex | {"Phase1":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Phase2":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Phase3":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.TractionBattery.Charging.Location | complex | {"Latitude":{"type":"double","value":0},"Longitude":{"type":"double","value":0},"Altitude":{"type":"double","value":0.0}} |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.TractionBattery.Number1.CurrentElectricity | complex | {"Voltage":{"type":"float","value":0.0},"Current":{"type":"float","value":0.0}} |
    | Vehicle.Powertrain.Transmission.CurrentGear | int8 | 0 |
    

